    {
      "text": "Political strife, popularity decline, instability of era and fewer students caused Chopin to struggle financially.",
      "stop": true
    },
    {
      "text": "With the cellist Auguste Franchomme.",
      "stop": true
    },
    {
      "text": "The Free Hanseatic City of Bremen includes the cities of Bremen and Bremervörde.",
      "stop": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Hamburg and Berlin are called Stadtkreise (city-states).",
      "stop": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Active flight ability has played an important role for insects because their muscles are able to contract multiple times for each single nerve impulse, allowing the wings to beat faster than would ordinarily be possible.",
      "stop": true
